    <bpmn:process id="W_W3348" name="W3348. Diversity, Pay-Equity &amp; Workforce Composition Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual; ESG/reporting cycle (links to VS-25.2); complements VS-102 W3309
Frequency: Quarterly/annual
Volume: Workforce-wide
Owner: People Analytics Manager
Participants: People Analytics Manager, C&amp;B (links to VS-102), EX/DEI (links to W3343), ESG (links to VS-25.2), Legal (links to VS-100)
Source: workflow W3348 — Diversity, Pay-Equity &amp; Workforce Composition Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3348_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3348_Lane1" name="People Analytics Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3348_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3348_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3348_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3348_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3348_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3348_Start3" name="Annual; ESG/reporting cycle (links to VS-25.2); complements VS-102 W3309">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3348_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3348_Task4" name="People Analytics Manager compile workforce composition: gender, age, PWD…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: People Analytics Manager compile workforce composition: gender, age, PWD, indigenous/minority representation, by role/level/entity; identify under-representation and barriers
Responsible (R): People Analytics Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3348_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3348_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3348_Task5" name="People Analytics Manager integrate pay-equity analysis (links to VS-102 W3309)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: People Analytics Manager integrate pay-equity analysis (links to VS-102 W3309), promotion-equity, and representation in hiring pipeline (links to W3346) into a holistic equity view; flag risks
Responsible (R): People Analytics Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3348_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3348_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3348_Task6" name="People Analytics Manager/Legal prepare diversity and pay-equity disclosures for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: People Analytics Manager/Legal prepare diversity and pay-equity disclosures for ESG/sustainability reporting (links to VS-25.2) and board (links to VS-36), under privacy controls (links to VS-91), and track progress vs targets
Responsible (R): People Analytics Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3348_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3348_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3348_End7" name="Complete">
