        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-540 (ensure controlled execution — People Analytics, Workforce Planning &amp; HR Technology (PA-103.3).) | - operational: change management; operational: audit and control review (links to VS-21)
Owner: HR Shared Services Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
